  /// promotion is in progress. FAILING_OVER - an unplanned promotion is in
  /// progress. PENDING_REMOVAL - replication is being stopped. DETACHED - the
  /// relationship has ended. EJECTED - a failover promoted the other domain.
  /// The former primary keeps the data it had when it was ejected and stays
  /// read-only until you remove the peer, or discard that data and pair
